    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1346">

                <pb facs="1156" n="1052" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1052"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/567.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic"> Brown Brothers &amp; Co. and J. and W. Seligman Co. to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_apparent-typo-based-on-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1913-09-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 4, 1919</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Yesterday we held a conference with Mr.
                    Douglas (of the firm of Douglas, Baker, Ruffin &amp; Obear, counsel for
                    Nicaragua) with reference to the proposed new loan to the Republic of
                    Nicaragua.</p>
                <p>Our memorandum of August 9th<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1346-f1"/> has now been
                    modified by our letter to you of August 26th<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1346-f2"/>
                    and our telegram to you of August 28th<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1346-f3"/> and our
                    conference with Mr. Douglas on September 3rd. We have accordingly, had a
                    memorandum prepared which embodies in one document all of these various
                    suggestions and now enclose herewith a copy thereof for your attention.</p>
                <p>We have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brown Brothers</hi> &amp; Co. <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. &amp; W. Seligman</hi> &amp; Co.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d1346-a1.xml" xpointer="d1346-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
